  "arduino": "// Adafruit NeoPixel library (Arduino Library Manager).\n// A 4×4 matrix stores its 16 pixels in row-major order.\n#include <Adafruit_NeoPixel.h>\nconst int DATA_PIN = 6;\nconst int PIXEL_COUNT = 16;\nAdafruit_NeoPixel pixels(PIXEL_COUNT, DATA_PIN, NEO_GRB + NEO_KHZ800);\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pixels.begin();\n  pixels.clear();\n  pixels.show();\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  static int frame = 0;\n  pixels.clear();\n  pixels.setPixelColor(frame % PIXEL_COUNT, 100, 60, 10);\n  pixels.show();\n  frame++;\n  delay(120);\n}\n",
